     version used `top: -10px; height: 60px`, which put ~50px of the glow
     inside the card and rendered as a smudge across the first line of
     content instead of light spilling down from above. */
  .zone[data-shape='frame-thin']::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 100%;
    width: 160px;
    height: 36px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom, rgba(238, 138, 69, 0.35), transparent 75%);
    pointer-events: none;
