    .overlay {
      position: fixed;
    }

    /* `[data-shape]` (attribute presence, not a specific value) rather than
       plain `.zone` - every real .zone element always carries some
       data-shape value, so this matches them all, but critically it also
       *matches the same specificity* as the per-shape rules above
       (.zone[data-shape='cork'] etc: one class + one attribute selector
