       specificity regardless of being later in the file - confirmed by
       testing, cards kept their desktop pixel widths (300-460px) and
       rounded corners inside a 390px viewport, with page content bleeding
       through around them. Equal specificity + later in the cascade is
       what actually wins here. */
    .zone[data-shape] {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      right: auto;
      top: auto;
      transform: none;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      max-height: none;
      border-radius: 0;
